	<Description>Two single-mode fibres side by side, their cores a dozen pixels apart: the evanescent field of one reaches into the other, so light launched into fibre A crosses over into fibre B and back along the length, a directional coupler. The probe along A shows the beating, the cross-fibre probe the field across both cores. Switch source A off and B on to launch from the other fibre.</Description>
